+# UNGOVERNED: upstream's memory agent writes user facts straight to the database,
+# outside the Cortex ledger and outside any manifest. It stays disabled until every
+# memory write routes through a Cortex action with an actor and a ledger entry
+# (NETIE.md section 3; catalog gate for the airgpt row). Turning it on here is a
+# product decision, not a config tweak. The gate test
